  "synopsis": "Mizuki is an ordinary young man who dreams of becoming the strongest assassin. To achieve his goal, he travels to Harajuku in search of a hideout rumored to be frequented by Legendary assassins. However, what he finds is an unusual pink cafe staffed by an eccentric group of individuals, ranging from gyaru and gothic lolita to a centaur. Far from the intimidating and cool world of assassins he had imagined, Mizuki finds himself caught up in an unexpected reality in Harajuku.\n\n(Source: MAL News)",
